van Pamidimarri", "text": "10.\tBefore _Airplane!_, Canadian-American actor X had a long but unspectacular Hollywood career, mostly in serious leading or supporting roles. His best-remembered film at that point was a 1956 sci-fi classic, _Forbidden Planet_, in which he played the dashing Commander John J. Adams piloting a starship to a distant world to investigate the disappearance of a colony — a film often credited as a major influence on _Star Trek_. The ZAZ team cast him as Dr. Rumack precisely because he had no comedic reputation; they wanted him to deliver every absurd line as if it were Shakespeare. The strategy worked so completely that X spent the next 25 years almost exclusively in deadpan parody comedies, including the Y trilogy. ID X (10 points) and Y (10 points).", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T04:24:32Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Leslie", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T04:24:35Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Nielsen", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T04:24:39Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "It’s in the poster", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T04:24:45Z", "username": "మాन$", "text": "Twilight zone", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T04:24:46Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Y is naked gun", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T04:25:06Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Sorry posted the unredacted image by mistake", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T04:25:14Z", "username": "మాन$", "text": "Paper leak hogaya.", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has